  "solution": "**Calculation : **\n\n65% of 350 - ?% of 250 + 40% of 120 = 158\n\n⇒ 65/100 × 350 - x/100 × 250 + 40/100 × 120 = 158\n\n⇒ 65/10 × 35 - x/10 × 25 + 48 = 158\n\n⇒ 227.5 - 5x/2 + 48 = 158\n\n⇒ 227.5 - 5x/2 = 110\n\n⇒ 227.5 - 110 = 5x/2\n\n⇒ 117.5 = 5x/2\n\n⇒ 235 = 5x\n\n⇒ x = 47\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 47.**",
